{"page": 134, "text": "We generally service the residential mortgage loans that we originate, which provides ongoing borrower engagement throughout the life of the loan. Our servicing operations are organized into performing and special servicing divisions. The performing servicing division services performing Agency and government-insured loans, while the special servicing division services delinquent Agency, government-insured and non-Agency loans on behalf of loan owners. The special servicing division also provides servicing for third-party portfolios owned by unaffiliated investors. 101\nThe table below provides the mix of Newrez\u2019s serviced assets portfolio between subserviced performing servicing (labeled as \u201cPerforming Servicing\u201d) and subserviced non-performing or special servicing (labeled as \u201cSpecial Servicing\u201d). Third-party servicing includes loan portfolios serviced on behalf of Rithm Capital or its subsidiaries and non-affiliated third parties for the periods presented.\nUPB as of\n(in millions) September 30,\n2026 June 30,\n2026 September 30,\n2025 QoQ Change YoY Change\nPerforming Servicing:\nMSR-owned assets $ 551,919 $ 548,963 $ 527,071 $ 2,956 $ 24,848\nResidential whole loans 2,357 2,233 3,638 124 (1,281)\nTotal Performing Servicing 554,276 551,196 530,709 3,080 23,567\nSpecial Servicing:\nMSR-owned assets 20,116 19,046 13,561 1,070 6,555\nResidential whole loans 13,936 12,436 8,633 1,500 5,303\nThird-party 266,452 253,732 269,160 12,720 (2,708)\nTotal Special Servicing 300,504 285,214 291,354 15,290 9,150\nTotal Newrez Servicing 854,780 836,410 822,063 18,370 32,717\nServiced by Third-Parties:\nMSR-owned assets 24,139 28,810 55,461 (4,671) (31,322)\nTotal Servicing Portfolio $ 878,919 $ 865,220 $ 877,524 $ 13,699 $ 1,395\nAgency Servicing:\nMSR-owned assets $ 373,274 $ 375,046 $ 380,422 $ (1,772) $ (7,148)\nThird-party 29,500 29,904 70,922 (404) (41,422)\nTotal Agency Servicing 402,774 404,950 451,344 (2,176) (48,570)\nGov