pared to the nine months ended September 30, 2025\nAsset management revenue was $356.2 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2026, an increase of $88.6 million, compared to $267.6 million for the nine months ended September 30, 2025. The increase was primarily attributable to $79.9 million of management fees and $9.1 million of incentive fees from Crestline and $4.8 million of management fees from Elecor, both acquired in December 2025.\nCommercial Real Estate Revenue\nThree months ended September 30, 2026 compared to the three months ended June 30, 2026\nCommercial real estate revenue was $187.0 million for the three months ended September 30, 2026, an increase of $4.9 million compared to $182.1 million for the three months ended June 30, 2026, reflecting stronger rental performance across the leasing portfolio.\nNine months ended September 30, 2026 compared to the nine months ended September 30, 2025\n"}
